// Continental seed 101, 2 AIs, start epoch 3 (Bronze): P2 base ~80,52, P3 base ~40,42.
// A defence test: P3 builds its defences (towers, walls) for 15 minutes; P2 doesn't use the defence layout and gets a
// big army at minute 15 to attack with (first attacks from minute 16-18 via the base ini).
// A/B: "def:" (P3 uses the layout) vs "nodef:defence_layout=0" (nobody does).

defence(2, 0)
wait_until(15min)
spawn(2, unit.inf02_spearman, 76, 50, 20)
spawn(2, unit.arch03_simple_bowman, 76, 58, 12)
spawn(2, unit.cav04_bronze_spear_cavalry, 82, 58, 8)
spawn(2, unit.gun_siege04_catapult, 72, 54, 3)
